# the one quick settings API (step 3b part 7): its menu behind it is the Play 6 Family's (Play6Menu)
src/org/lumen/projector/panel/QuickPanel.java
# its power key and power actions, Android sleep only (core feature play6-start; a fork of core power/PowerKey)
